The bothy-kube action log lands here (compose.yml mounts ./audit:/audit).

Committed, empty, on bothy-control's reasoning: docker creates a missing bind
source as root, this service runs as uid 1000, and audit() swallows a write
failure by design - so a missing directory would be a silently empty log.
actions.log itself is gitignored by the repo-wide *.log rule.
